# Admin web app — environment variables
# Local: VITE_API_URL ni o'chiring — Vite /api/v1 va /media ni 127.0.0.1:8000 ga proxy qiladi.
# DEV_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Production (Vercel admin.mysaloon.uz):
# VITE_API_URL ni o'chiring yoki e'tiborsiz qoldiring — prod build always same-origin
# `/api/v1` (Vercel rewrite → api.mysaloon.uz). Bu CORS / 502-as-CORS muammosini oldini oladi.
# Faqat debug: VITE_API_DIRECT=1 va VITE_API_URL=https://api.mysaloon.uz

# Google Maps JS (geo xarita):
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
